<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Document Conversion</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #000;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .text-block {
    text-align: justify;
    margin-bottom: 1em;
  }
  .centered {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .signature-line {
    margin-top: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .footer {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 20px;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: right;
    font-size: 0.8em;
    color: #555;
  }
</style>

<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  }
  p {
    text-align: justify;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .notes-section {
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
  .notes-section h3 {
    font-size: 14pt;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .note-list {
    list-style-type: none;
    padding-left: 0;
  }
  .note-list li {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 10pt;
    text-align: justify;
  }
  .footer {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 50px;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 10pt;
    color: #555;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="centered">
    <h1>Géométrie, finesse et premiers principes chez Pascal</h1>
    <div class="signature-line">
      <span data-field="author_name">{{ author_name }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="text-block">
    Ce sont les esprits géométriques de Pascal; il ne sont que logiques; ils n'ont point l'esprit de finesse qu'il faut pour suivre les phénomènes naturels.
    <br><br>
    —<span data-field="source_citation">{{ source_citation }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="text-block">
    <span data-field="paragraph_1">{{ paragraph_1 }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="text-block">
    <span data-field="paragraph_2">{{ paragraph_2 }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">121</div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="text-block">
    <span data-field="paragraph_3">{{ paragraph_3 }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="text-block">
